Title: Slight login fix and hard password recovery fix

Changes:
login.php:
- Removed getuserip() function as it already exists in connect.php
password_recovery.php:
- Added check to see if an account exists with the email address
- Adds an extra step to ensure an email is provided
- Give feedback to the user if any error occurs
- Added html form for the user to input their password
- Changed to use mysqli instead of pdo
- Changed to be able to send mails through gmail
reset_password.php:
- Changed to use mysqli instead of pdo
- Used bind_param and get_result to bind parameters and fetching results
- Added error handling
- Added isset around user in the check if the request method is not not a post
- Included .env file and put in the google app password